---
/**
 * Hero section — 浅色首页首屏
 */
---

<section class="tech-noise relative overflow-hidden border-b border-[#e6ecff] bg-white px-6 pt-24 pb-16 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-32">
  <div class="aiecnu-hero-waves absolute inset-0"></div>
  <div class="tech-grid absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="tech-orb tech-orb--primary"></div>
  <div class="tech-orb tech-orb--secondary"></div>
  <div class="tech-particles">
    <span class="tech-particle"></span>
    <span class="tech-particle"></span>
    <span class="tech-particle"></span>
    <span class="tech-particle"></span>
    <span class="tech-particle"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/images/docs/shot-01.png"
      alt="Inno Agent 工作区界面预览"
      width="980"
      height="612"
      class="hero-screenshot absolute bottom-[-2rem] right-[-18rem] w-[980px] max-w-none rounded-lg border border-[#e1e8ff] bg-white object-cover shadow-2xl sm:right-[-12rem] lg:right-[max(-8rem,calc((100vw-72rem)/2-10rem))]"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,#ffffff_0%,#ffffff_36%,rgba(255,255,255,0.82)_58%,rgba(255,255,255,0.26)_100%)]"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/82 lg:bg-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-28 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <div class="fade-in-up tech-badge inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#555aff] shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">
        <span class="tech-pulse inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#555aff]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        开源个人学习 Agent · 分层记忆 · 本地优先
      </div>

      <h1 class="fade-in-up mt-8 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl" data-delay="1">
        让 AI 记住学习过程，<span class="tech-gradient-text">而不只是回答问题</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="fade-in-up mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 sm:text-xl" data-delay="2">
        Inno Agent 把学习者画像、知识 Wiki、会话记录、主动复习和 Practice Lab 组织成一个长期学习闭环，让通用模型拥有可持续的教学上下文。
      </p>

      <div class="fade-in-up mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap" data-delay="3">
        <a href="https://app.inno-agent.cn/login"
           target="_blank"
           rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="tech-cta inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#555aff] px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#555aff]/25 hover:bg-[#464cf0]">
          开始使用
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/getting-started/introduction/"
           class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#dfe5ff] bg-white px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-[#555aff] hover:text-[#555aff]">
          使用说明
        </a>
        <a href="#demos"
           class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#dfe5ff] bg-white px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-[#555aff] hover:text-[#555aff]">
          场景演示
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl class="fade-in-up mt-12 grid max-w-xl grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-[#dfe6ff] pt-6" data-delay="4">
        <div class="tech-glass rounded-lg p-3">
          <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">核心架构</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950">L1 / L2 / L3</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-glass rounded-lg p-3">
          <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">学习闭环</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950">诊断 + 练习</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-glass rounded-lg p-3">
          <dt class="text-sm text-slate-500">部署形态</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950">本地 / 私有</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tech-scanline"></div>
</section>
